OL,3,AIran vows 'decisive response' to first
OL,4,AUS strikes in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran responded by attacking US military
OL,7,Fbases in Jordan, according to state
OL,8,Fmedia. Jordan's army said it had
OL,9,Fintercepted eight missiles early on
OL,10,FMonday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
